#AREA Arctic Forest~

#AUTHORS Atari~

#RANGES 10 17 0 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NOCASTLE

#RESETMSG An arctic wind blows through the trees..~

#TEMPERATURE -30 40 5 2

#HELPS
-1 arctic forest~
A small forest near the Deeve which houses only animals.
The environment is much too harsh to become a habitat for any 
human. Although there are rumors that people have seen a man
that supposedly lives near one of the hot springs.
~
-1 arcticupdate~
area version in use is 2.4 final
~
0 $~

#MOBILES
#28300
timber wolf~
The timber wolf~
A wolf stands here glaring at you.~
In front of you is a small wolf, fur covered with snow and ice 
resulting from the climate around it. It's stare alone makes it
look like a formidable opponent.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_IS_NPC
AFF_HUNT
0 S
13 BODY_TAIL|BODY_MOUTH BODY_TAIL|BODY_MOUTH 10d6+130 2d6+7
400 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>all_greet_prog 70~
growl $n
~
>death_prog 100~
if rand(10)
    MPOLOAD 28300
    MPECHO some meat falls out of the side of the corpse.
    MPQUIET ON
    drop I28300
    MPQUIET OFF
endif
~
|
#28301
bear~
The bear~
A huge bear lies here deep in slumber.~
A large bear lies inside his cave waiting for spring to arrive so
he can feed his voracious appetite on many of the smaller critters
scattered about the rest of the forest. Might not want to mess 
with it, looks kinda happy as it is. Try to kill it.. If you want 
to go back to Chakkor in a body bag.
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_BODY|ACT_IS_NPC
AFF_SANCTUARY
0 S
15 BODY_MOUTH BODY_MOUTH 5d40+100 5d5+5
200 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>all_greet_prog 100~
MPECHO The bear wakes from it's slumber.
MPKILL $n
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0,3,$n) == 2
    MPOLOAD 28301
    MPECHO The bear falls and knocks a fine looking rucksack from the middle of the pine needles.
    MPQUIET ON
    drop I28301
    MPQUIET OFF
else
    MPECHO The bear lets out a horrifying growl and falls over... Dead.
endif
~
|
