#28304
starving man~
The starving man~
A man wearing tattered clothing lies huddled in the snow.~
The man has wrapped himself in multiple layers of clothing to
protect himself from the biting cold, but from the looks of it,
the hardships of making it here took their toll as seen by the 
multiple holes and tears in the fabrics. He looks content with 
the clothing he wears, but he has grown weary from starvation 
and attacks from animals.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND
0 S
20 BODY_ARM|BODY_TORSO BODY_ARM|BODY_LEG|BODY_HEAD 5d50+5000 5d5+20
0 RACE_HUMAN
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 20~
moan
~
>give_prog I28300~
if quest(0,3,$n) == 4
 or quest(0,3,$n) == 3
  or quest(0,3,$n) == 2
      say More meat? Thank you. I guess I'll save this for later.
      MPJUNK all
    else
      if rand(20)
          say Thanks! That bit of meat hit the spot! 
          say If you could do one more thing for me, I may be able to
          say help you out. Do you think you could help me?
          MPJUNK all
          MPMSET $n quest 0 3 1
       else
          smile
          MPECHO The man eats some of the meat and resumes resting.
          MPJUNK all
      endif
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest(0,3,$n) == 1
    say Great, Here's my problem.
    say When I was coming out here, I was attacked by an animal
    say and knocked unconscious. I was carrying with me a
    say rucksack containing a very valuable item. When I awoke 
    say my rucksack was missing and there were no remnants of 
    say it anywhere. I think it's still in the forest. 
    say All I need you to do is find it and return it to me.
    say Good Luck.
    MPMSET $n quest 0 3 2
else
    say Yes, what?
endif
~
>give_prog I28301~
if quest(0,3,$n) == 2
    say Great, You've found it.
    MPECHO The man opens the rucksack up and peers inside.
    say It's EMPTY! How can it be EMPTY?!
    say I need the helm that was in here!
    MPFORCE $n say It was empty when I got it!!
    say You gotta find it! it means a lot to me..
    whimper
    say Here. Use this to find it. I'm sorry I can't be of more
    say help, but this will locate the helmet for you if you're
    say in the same room as it is. It may take time to work..
    MPOLOAD 28305
    give I28305 $n
    MPMSET $n quest 0 3 3
    MPJUNK all
else
    look $n
    say Thank you.
    wake
    c heal $n
    rest
    MPJUNK all
endif
~
>give_prog I28302~
if quest(0,3,$n) == 3
    say Sweet! Thanks much for all your help.
    say Now what can I reward you with...
    MPECHO The man rummages through his belongings.
    MPQUIET ON    
    MPOLOAD 28303
    MPOLOAD 28321
    wake
    c 'giant strength' $n
    give I28303 $n
    give I28321 $n
    rest
    MPQUIET OFF
    MPECHOAT $n The man gives you some valuable possessions.
    MPECHOAROUND $n The man gives $n some valuable possessions.
    smile
    say Thanks again.
    wink $n
    MPMSET $n quest 0 3 4
    MPJUNK all
else
    look $n
    say Thank you.
    wake 
    c heal $n
    MPJUNK all
    rest
endif
~
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(0,3,$n) == 4
    smile $n
endif
~
>SPEECH_PROG p Hey reset my shit!~
say Great! Here goes!
MPECHO Starving guy waves his magic quest bit setting wand over $n.
MPMSET $n quest 0 3 0
MPMSET $n quest 3 5 0
MPMSET $n quest 9 3 0
say There ya go. All set! Now off with ya!
~
|
