AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
13 BODY_WING BODY_WING 10d10+100 2d7+6
20 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>ALL_GREET_PROG 90~
if level ($n) <= 35
   RESCALE 28305 $n 90
   MPECHOAT $n A bat flies down from the ceiling and attacks you!
   MPECHOAROUND $n A bat flies down from the ceiling and attacks $n!
   MPKILL $n
else
   MPECHOAT $n A bat flies down from the ceiling and attacks you!
   MPECHOAROUND $n A bat flies down from the ceiling and attacks $n!
   MPKILL $n
endif
~
