#28309
Nathan~
Nathan Price~
Nathan sits here on his throne eyeing you down.~
Nathan sits here on his throne pondering how he is going to take over
the rest of the planet with the least effort and most potential
product. Looks like he's recruiting help.
~
ACT_BODY|ACT_IS_NPC|ACT_SMART|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
140 BODY_ARM|BODY_TORSO BODY_ARM|BODY_TORSO 1D1+25000 1D1+4000
0 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>RAND_PROG 10~
cackle
grin
~
>GREET_PROG 100~
IF quest (3,5,$n) == 0
   tell $n Heyyy.. You wouldn't be interested in helping me would ya?
   MPMSET $n quest 3 5 1
ELSE
   IF quest (3,5,$n) == 3
      IF ACTORHASOBJNUM(19814)
         say What is this?!? Just a sheepskin?? That musta taken you
         say 5 minutes to earn.
         grumble
         say That's one time you've failed me. You should have a
         say doctorate by now.
         say Off to the monster pit with ya. Come back if you're still alive.
         MPMSET $n quest 3 5 4
         MPECHO Nathan utters the words 'ouewofbwobn'
         MPTRANSFER $n 28383
         MPQUIET ON
         MPGOTO 28383
         MPMLOAD 28310
         RESCALE 28310 $n 100
         MPGOTO 28380
         MPQUIET OFF
      ELSE
         say What are you doing coming back here without a diploma?!
         say Get back out there!
         MPTRANSFER $n 9755
      ENDIF
   ELSE
     IF quest (3,5,$n) == 4 
        say Whoa there cheetah. Tryin to skip a little ahead?
        say If you injure my pet, next time you kill it.
        say Capiche?
        say Wait.. Next time? Who says there'll be a next time.
        wave $n
        MPMSET $n quest 3 5 16
        slay $n
   ELSE
     IF quest (3,5,$n) == 5
        say Heyy.. Good job. You might not have the smarts, but you got
        say a bit of muscle behind ya. Guess I'll let ya go on anyway.
        say Now that you've got a diploma.. No matter how small it is..
        curse
        say I'll need ya to help me acquire some territory in a place
        say called Landover. The land isn't worth much, but..
        say hey, it's a start.
        say Go for it.
        MPMSET $n quest 3 5 7
        MPECHO Nathan utters the words 'fbesfo'
        MPTRANSFER $n 9755
  ELSE 
    IF quest (3,5,$n) == 6
        say Whoa there cheetah. Tryin to skip a little ahead?
        say If you injure my pet, next time you kill it.
        say Capiche?
        say Wait.. Next time? Who says there'll be a next time.
        wave $n
        MPMSET $n quest 3 5 16
        slay $n
  ELSE   
    IF quest (3,5,$n) == 7
       IF ACTORHASOBJNUM(15031)
          say What is this garbage?!? That's all they gave you?! The KING
          say OF LANDOVER?!?
          grumble
          say THAT MAKES ME FURIOUS!!
          cackle
          say YOU SHOULD DIE FOR ACCEPTING THAT TRASH FROM THEM!
          MPECHO Nathan utters the words 'hfwoeifweopn'
          MPMSET $n quest 3 5 8
          MPQUIET ON
          MPTRANSFER $n 28384
          MPGOTO 28384
          MPMLOAD 28311
          RESCALE 28311 $n 115
          MPGOTO 28380
          MPQUIET OFF
       ELSE
          say Whoa whoa whoa.. Get out there and finish that quest!
          say Pronto kid!
          MPECHO Nathan utters the words 'bfewbuoi'
          MPTRANSFER $n 9755
       ENDIF
  ELSE
    IF quest (3,5,$n) == 8
       say Whoa there cheetah. Tryin to skip a little ahead?
       say If you injure my pet, next time you kill it.
       say Capiche?
       say Wait.. Next time? Who says there'll be a next time.
       wave $n
       MPMSET $n quest 3 5 16
       slay $n
  ELSE
    IF quest (3,5,$n) == 9
       say Wow, Hey.. Who woulda thought, eh?
       say Looks like yer still alive. Sorry bout that. I get kinda
       say angry sometimes. I won't do that again. Anyway, I've got
       say one more job for ya.
       say Now that you have a sheepskin and a little bit of a kingdom
       say out in the boonies, there might be a chance you can pull
       say this off. It seems Midgaard is holding an election for town
       say mayor right now. That sounds like a pretty reasonable slot
       say for a future ruler of the world to control. All I need you
       say to do is win the mayor spot. And even though you've screwed
       say up so far, you should be able to pull this off. At least
       say bring back a badge!
       say Begone!
       MPECHO Nathan utters the words 'opwjrthf'
       MPMSET $n quest 3 5 10
       MPTRANSFER $n 9755
  ELSE
    IF quest (3,5,$n) == 10
       IF ACTORHASOBJNUM(3373)
          say Dear god man. I don't even have to say anything. Just die.
          say Oh yeah. I promised not to send ya to any more monsters..
          say Oh well. I lied.
          cackle $n
          MPMSET $n quest 3 5 11
          MPQUIET ON
          MPTRANSFER $n 28385
          MPGOTO 28385
          MPMLOAD 28312
          RESCALE 28312 $n 130
          MPGOTO 28380
          MPQUIET OFF
       ELSE
          say You should know by now to have completed the task before
          say you come back. Stop being ignorant and get the job done.
          MPTRANSFER $n 9755
       ENDIF
  ELSE
    IF quest (3,5,$n) == 11
       say Whoa there cheetah. Tryin to skip a little ahead?
       say If you injure my pet, next time you kill it.
       say Capiche?
       say Wait.. Next time? Who says there'll be a next time.
       wave $n
       MPMSET $n quest 3 5 16
       slay $n
  ELSE
    IF quest (3,5,$n) == 12
       say Gawd..
       say You've found my secret hideout.
       say You've killed all my pets.
       say *AND* You've ruined my chances of world domination.
       say Forget it. Get out. Just leave.
       MPECHO Nathan throws whatever was closest to him at you and utters the words 'fjiewopfipo'
       MPMSET $n quest 3 5 16
       MPQUIET ON
       c giant $n
       MPOLOAD 28309
       MPOLOAD 28310
       c 'remove curse'
       c 'remove curse'
       drop all
       MPFORCE $n get all
       MPQUIET OFF
   muhaha $n
   MPTRANSFER $n 9755
  ELSE
    IF quest (3,5,$n) == 16
       say What are you thinking coming back here?
       say OUT!
       MPECHO Nathan utters the words 'kcsaddf'
       MPTRANSFER $n 9755
ENDIF
~
>SPEECH_PROG yes~
IF quest (3,5,$n) == 1
   tell $n Well, ya know my work isn't exactly *ethical*, but If
   tell $n you're still interested, just let me know.
   MPMSET $n quest 3 5 2
ELSE
   say Uhhh. what?
   drool $n
ENDIF
~
>SPEECH_PROG interested~
IF quest (3,5,$n) == 2
   tell $n Good, good.. I knew you wouldn't let me down.
   grin $n
   tell $n Well, here's the plan. I'm tryin to take over a bit of
   tell $n the planet and I lack a little bit of conviction out
   tell $n there.. Sure I'm powerful, but it's just not enough. I
   tell $n lack a certain *charisma* you seem to possess. And it 
   tell $n looks like I'll need someone like you to help me gain
   tell $n enough political convincing to get my hands on my 
   tell $n small piece of the world to get me started. Anyway, 
   tell $n here's what I need you to do.
   tell $n First things first. People like an educated leader so
   tell $n I'll need you to go and earn yourself a diploma from 
   tell $n somewhere. That should earn ya some respect. I'll 
   tell $n transfer you out of here to get you started.
   MPMSET $n quest 3 5 3
   MPTRANSFER $n 9755
ELSE
   say Interested in what? 
   say Man.. and people think *I'm* crazy.. Sheesh
ENDIF
~
>SPEECH_PROG Atari~
say I think I know that guy..
~
