>greet_prog 20~
sniff
~
>speech_prog pictures~
IF QUEST (9,3,$n) == 0
sniff
say Those are pictures of my boy. He's been missing for
say a couple days now. The village has searched all over
say for him, but no luck.
MPMSET $n QUEST 9 3 1
else
say Nice aren't they?
endif
~
>speech_prog help~
IF QUEST (9,3,$n) == 1
   emote 's eyes brighten.
   say You want to help me find my boy?
   smile $n
   say The last place we say him was the forest.
   say I hope you find him.
   MPMSET $n QUEST 9 3 2
else
   sniff
endif
~
>give_prog i28314~
cry
say NO!!
emote takes a pulse..
say He's still alive!
emote slaps the corpse around a bit.
MPECHO The boy opens his eyes and stands up.
MPECHO The boy says 'Whoa. Oww..'
say DON'T YOU EVER DO THAT AGAIN!
emote raises her hand high and commences to spanking the heck out of the kid.
say NOW GO TO YOUR ROOM!
MPECHO The boy says 'Yesss mommm....'
MPECHO The boy takes off crying up to his room.
say Thank you.. If you run into any trouble in the
say forest, you'll have our support.
smile $n
MPMSET $n QUEST 9 3 4
MPJUNK i28314
~
